+//  HLG and PQ — or, by `framejob_export_i420`, to video-range 8-bit I420, each
+//  sample one byte (yuv420p) — `vp9_webm`'s SDR picture. Owned by
+//  `app/Sources/ExportI010.swift`, which scales the frame to the export size
+//  first when it is not the canvas.
